#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-10-02-000004.md:14
msgid "動画処理に必要なパラメーターがありません。video_pathsが空のリストの場合も実行できません。"
msgstr ""
"Video processing was submitted without a required parameter; an empty "
"video_paths list is also rejected."

